Upstream source: https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain
Original base revision: da704dd9fd710df5c6c93ea2d31a028837d93d85

Original author notices are retained in the source files. Local changes include
SpeechLLM/Hugging Face integration, batch sampling and runtime support. This
release retains only the transitive runtime required by ASSET, simplifies package
initializers, and resolves legacy Hugging Face import paths directly. It is not
a complete distribution of the SpeechBrain toolkit.

The shared SpeechLLM recipe is based on work by Adel Moumen (2025).
ASSET-specific segmentation, pooling and training extensions were added in 2026.
